  "worked_solution": "First, let's recall the product rule for logarithms:\n\n$$\n{log}_{n}⁡a+{log}_{n}⁡b={log}_{n}⁡(ab)\n$$\n\nUsing the product rule, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{log}_{5}⁡(st) & ={log}_{5}⁡s+{log}_{5}⁡t \\\\  & =4+5 \\\\  & =9.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
